OL,3,AHoliday lets owner 'devastated' by
OL,4,Aphishing scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a small property
OL,7,Fmanagement firm said she was
OL,8,F"devastated and exhausted" after
OL,9,Fthousands of fake property reservations
OL,10,Fwere advertised in her company's name
OL,11,Fon Booking.com.
OL,13,FVictoria Pollard, who runs Exeter-based
OL,14,FLife's 2 Short, said some of those who
OL,15,Fmade the bookings had travelled from
OL,16,Foverseas and were left with nowhere to
OL,17,Fstay.
OL,19,FThe 46-year-old said the phishing
OL,20,Fattack had left her with no access to
OL,21,Fher accounts in August, causing genuine
OL,22,Freservations to be missed.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
