OL,3,AHoliday lets owner 'devastated' by
OL,4,Aphishing scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FBooking.com has apologised, saying it
OL,7,Fwas offering its "full support" to
OL,8,FPollard. It added all impacted listings
OL,9,Fwere removed and customers offered
OL,10,F"relocations, refunds or free
OL,11,Fcancellations".
